COPYING
-------

This file describes the locations of the licenses under with the files
comprising Alatar may be copied and distributed.

License files can be found at the top level director of the Alatar project
(the same location as this file).

Currently the following licenses are used by the various files in this
project:
    - LICENSE-GPL
    
Source files will indicate the relevant license (usually the GPL) at the top
of the file.

Other files for which it is possible to embed an indication of the license
under which they may be copied and distributed will have that information
included.

If there are files (such as graphics) that cannot have an indication of the
license embedded the containing directory will contain a license.txt file
indicating which license applies to the files in that directory.

No copyright is asserted over this file.  It maybe copied/distributed freely
and without limitation.


